{"id": 95508, "field": "objectives", "ja": "Terry LongdrinkとKul Tirasの海兵隊との遭遇を、Waltonが生き延びられるよう手助けしてください。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q-quest-objectives-02-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "fb874c5b9d07bc46", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70124"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 95508, "field": "description", "ja": "ああ、かつてはKul Tirasの海軍にいた。Lord AdmiralがTheramoreを奪ってDurotarでの作戦を始めた後、俺はそのやり方に……「異議」があってな。特に、民間人を処刑するやり方にだ。\n\n話にはまだ続きがあるんだが……待て……あれは何だ？\n\n男たちの一団が尾根を登ってくるぞ！", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q-quest-description-03-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "5b6957f00ab4a9bd", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70124"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
