{"id": 95803, "field": "objectives", "ja": "Rudolph Gelhardtの首をUndercityのSylvanas Windrunnerに届けてください。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q-quest-objectives-02-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "09f1d51144971207", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70124"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 95803, "field": "description", "ja": "汚れた司令官の首を取った今、それをUndercityへ届けてもらいたい。Sylvanas Windrunnerは我々をひどく疑っていて、ほとんどあからさまに見下している。\n\nRudolph Gelhardtの首をDark Ladyに届けろ。我々が自分たちの家の始末は自分でつけ、Forsakenの繁栄に身を捧げていることを示すのだ。", "status": "trusted", "checks": ["names"], "provenance": {"class": "machine", "model": "claude-opus-5", "source": "draft-q-quest-description-03-sg6@2026-09-18", "imported": "2026-09-18"}, "english": {"hash": "27427458e9bc5241", "src": "wdb@1.60.1.70124"}, "reasons": [], "conflicts": []}
